*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]
...               5GC002640 Extended Inter band DL FDD + TDD FR1 CA up to 4CCs (FDD as PCell)
...               
...               The purpose of this test is to check the successful activation of FDD + TDD FR1 Classical Fullstack SA DL CA
...               up to 3CCs(FDD as PCell) with NRRELs pointing to 2 FDD and 2 TDD FR1 cells without gNB restart on
...               under DSS-PRB Blanking Interaction
...               Prerequisite : GNB and Airphone should be installed
...               Scope : Reach a cell setup state, and perfom basic tests :
...                       Ue Register, CRNTI checks, ...
...
...               Test Case Scenario author   : francois.tourlonnias@okia.com
...               Last Modified by            : francois.tourlonnias@okia.com

Resource          resources/robot/5GC002640_Keywords_fs_apovabio.robot
Resource          resources/robot/5GC002640_Config_Keywords.robot

Force Tags        CA_5G_SW_FR-Villarceaux    RRM
...               PY36
...               SBTS00    SBTS23R1    SBTS22R4
...               CLOUD_5G_I_BOO_AP_LOO
...               VARIANT_SANSA_FS_ECPRI_CMWV_FDD+TDD
...               master_classicalbts_all    AP_REG
...               CONFIGURED    5G_RAN    RAN_5G    CRT

Suite Setup       Suite Setup From Scratch       # ${FD_ALL}
...               keepAllUeDataInCfgFile=${True}
...               automaticTeardown=FirstFail
...               yamlPathname=${CURDIR}/../../../../../custom-config/${feature path}${custom_config_file}


Suite Teardown    Suite Teardown
Test Teardown     Test Teardown 5GC002640

*** Variables ***
${feature path}                          IBCA/5GC002640/booaploo/
${custom_config_file}                    custom_config_2640-F_booaploo.yaml
${VMmonitoring}               ${False}
@{DssCellList}=               @{EMPTY}
# variable set to ${True} to automatically save SOSreport even in any case
# (by default, these information are saved only if a test is failed)
${ForceDebugDataCollection}    ${False}
#${ForceDebugDataCollection}    ${True}
${TRF_ongoing}                ${False}
${enable_sherpa}              ${False}

# preset of variables for QC settings
${F_Restart}      FAILED
${F_CellSetup}    FAILED
${F_DSS}          FAILED
${F_2}            FAILED

&{NrRel_TargetedbyWeight_List_FFT}
...    NRCELL-1=51    NRCELL-2=54

${param}    ${TC-F}
*** Test Cases ***
[1][1.0] 5GC002640-5G-F_TC_02_Buffer_based_Scell_Activation_DSS_Super_fast_allocation_enabled_in_FDD_PCell
    [Documentation]   The aim of this test is to check that ScellActivation is Ok when DSS and PRB Blanking low Edge
    ...               are enabled

    5GC002640-5G-F
    gNB_Startup_Ok_with_Flags
    Cell_Setup

    Run Keyword if    '${F_2}' == 'FAILED'    FAIL    dependencies issue


*** Keywords ***

5GC002640-5G-F

    [Documentation]                 Carrier Aggregation 5GC002640-5G-F  6CC FTT (52 51 54)
    Init Sequence                            ${param}
    TestSuiteFolderCreation     step=TestStart
    Collect_Configfiles         step=TestStart
    Critical Step                   5GC002640-5G-F_Settings
    TestSuiteFolderCreation     step=configReady
    Collect_Configfiles         step=configReady
    Critical Step                   5GC002640-5G-F_Cell_Setup    DSS_SuperFastAlloc=${True}
    # Critical Step                   5GC002640-5G-F_DSS_SuperFastAlloc
    Critical Step                   5GC002640-5G-F_UE_DSS_CA_ScellActivation_ueRegister_traffic

#  following TC are only for result MAPPING on QC ##
gNB_Startup_Ok_with_Flags
    [Documentation]   The aim of this test is to check that gNB startup is ok with the cpri link
    ...               and RU simulators AAHF(TDD)-AHLOA(FDD)
    Run Keyword if    '${F_Restart}' == 'FAILED'    FAIL    dependencies issue

Cell_Setup
    [Documentation]   The aim of this test is to check that gNB cell setup is ok with the 2255-1329
    ...               flags & parameters activated
    Run Keyword if    '${F_CellSetup}' == 'FAILED'    FAIL    dependencies issue


